sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as Navegador/HTTP
    participant MW as ResolveTenant Middleware
    participant Resolver as TenantConnectionResolver
    participant Platform as Platform DB
    participant TenantCtx as TenantContext (singleton)
    participant EstCtx as EstablishmentContext (singleton)
    participant App as Filament / Services
    participant TenantDB as Tenant DB (conexión dinámica)

    Client->>MW: HTTP Request (acme.pos.localhost/admin/...)
    MW->>MW: ¿Path = /platform/*? → SKIP

    MW->>Resolver: resolve(host="acme.pos.localhost")
    Resolver->>Resolver: Extract slug = "acme"
    Resolver->>Platform: SELECT * FROM platform_tenants WHERE slug='acme' AND status='active'
    Platform-->>Resolver: PlatformTenant {id, slug, display_name}

    alt Tenant encontrado
        Resolver->>Platform: SELECT * FROM platform_tenant_connections WHERE tenant_id=?
        Platform-->>Resolver: {driver, host, port, database, username, password(encrypted)}

        Resolver->>TenantCtx: useTenant(tenant)
        Note over TenantCtx: Singleton almacena<br/>PlatformTenant actual

        Resolver->>Resolver: DB::purge('tenant')
        Resolver->>Resolver: Merge credentials → config('database.connections.tenant')
        Resolver->>TenantDB: DB::reconnect('tenant')
        Resolver->>TenantDB: DB::setDefaultConnection('tenant')
        Note over TenantDB: Todas las queries now<br/>van al DB de "acme"
    else Tenant no encontrado (database mode)
        Resolver-->>Client: 404 Not Found
    else single mode
        Resolver->>TenantCtx: useTenant(default)
        Note over TenantDB: Se usa la conexión default<br/>(misma DB para todos)
    end

    MW->>App: $next($request)
    Note over App: Route models, services,<br/>repositories — todo usa<br/>la conexión "tenant"

    App->>TenantDB: Queries normales (Pedido, Producto, etc.)
    TenantDB-->>App: Resultados

    App-->>Client: Response

    MW->>Resolver: reset()
    MW->>EstCtx: reset()
    Note over TenantCtx,EstCtx: Limpieza post-request<br/>DB vuelve a default
